# A skill folder here may be symlinked into a working project, so the scripts
# run from inside this checkout. Keep what that produces out of git.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Anything a run writes: caches, snapshots, generated reports, broker exports.
data/
stocks/
PORTFOLIO.md
*holdings*.csv
tax-profile.json
*profile*.json
!skills/*/*-template.*

# Statements and spreadsheets: the file types personal records actually arrive
# in. Belt to the pre-commit hook's braces. Deliberate exception: `git add -f`.
#
# Matched by extension only, on purpose. Name patterns like *tax* would swallow
# a legitimate skill -- skills/advance-tax/ is exactly that -- and an ignored
# source file fails silently, which is worse than a noisy hook.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.ods
*.pdf
*.ofx
*.qif
